WEBVTT

00:13:57.834 --> 00:14:01.137
In fact, the chances that you get rejected
at some point in your life,

00:14:01.170 --> 00:14:03.005
at some point this year, are high.

00:14:03.439 --> 00:14:06.876
And worse, you may be rejected
as a function of who you are.

00:14:07.243 --> 00:14:09.712
Things about yourself
that you cannot change.

00:14:10.012 --> 00:14:11.748
Where you come from,

00:14:11.781 --> 00:14:14.617
what you look like or who you love.

00:14:17.053 --> 00:14:19.722
Being socially courageous
means pursuing experiences

00:14:19.756 --> 00:14:21.624
because they are important to you

00:14:21.624 --> 00:14:23.926
and knowing that the successes
of those pursuits

00:14:23.960 --> 00:14:27.096
are not contingent
on your worth as a human being.

00:14:28.264 --> 00:14:30.733
Being socially courageous
means knowing your worth